  {
    "id": 1246208298,
    "title": "Steal A Brainrot",
    "description": "-- NO advertising. --\n\nI FINALLY added mutations saving so uhm, go crazy\nI also added offline gain. Go crazier!\nUh, I did ALL the code for this, even the saving and loading(please free me from this)\n\nList of all current events!\n\n-- Taco, it occurs all Tuesday, allows Taco Sahur to Spawn and gives things the obese mutation --\n-- Wacky event occurs every 20 - 30 minutes, gives brainrots the sphere and wacked mutation --\n-- Sunlight, gives brainrots sunburnt mutation, occurs every 20-30 minutes --\n-- Mountain, Occurs every 20-30 minutes and gives brainrots the giant and titanic mutatition\n\n\nSPACE EVENT: occurs every ten minutes\ngives special limited alien mutation and space Brainrots!\n\n\n\n-----------------------BRAINROTS-----------------------------------\n • Tung Tung Tung Tung Tung Sahur(1$/S 15$, common)\n •Chimpanzini Bannanini(3$/s 80$, common)\n •Svivino Bombondino(7$/S 150$, common)\n •Tapla Di Fero(15$/S 600$, rare)\nTrulimero Trulichina(10$/s 300$, rare)\n• And more!(Just too lazy to add them)\n\n\n\n-----------------------UPDATE LOGS-----------------------------\n-Added offline gain 12/17/25\n- Added mobile controls, 11/26/25\n-Added Space event, 11/26/25",
    "instructions": "WASD for movement\nTap on the phone button if you are on mobile\nClick/Tap on brainrots to buy them\nE on brain-rots to sell them\nX to sell ALL brainrots\nP to save\nQ to load\nZ to zoomout\nPost your save data in the comments so that you don't lose them(or just like put them somewhere else)",
